## 378. 四个基本 Euler 状态

$$
\boxed{
\begin{array}{c|cc}
&\text{trace}&\text{supertrace}\\
\hline
\text{unbounded occupancy}
&
\zeta(s)
&
\dfrac{\zeta(2s)}{\zeta(s)}
\\[8pt]
\text{hard-core occupancy}
&
\dfrac{\zeta(s)}{\zeta(2s)}
&
\dfrac1{\zeta(s)}
\end{array}
}
$$

它们满足：

$$
\boxed{
\zeta(s)\cdot\frac1{\zeta(s)}=1,
}
$$

以及：

$$
\boxed{
\frac{\zeta(2s)}{\zeta(s)}
\cdot
\frac{\zeta(s)}{\zeta(2s)}
=1.
}
$$

这是一组严格的 trace–supertrace Ouroboros。

